SQLite versioning database for file history, checkpoints, undo/redo fuel, AI-edit recovery, and shareable workspace mirror databases. Versioning is UEB-backed and canonical in the protected Electron DB; repo-local mirror DBs are optional, disposable work product.

**Roadmap:** `ai/<machine>/Views/*-doc-viewer/specs/ROADMAP-REVISED.md` Phase 2.7
